<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Since it hasn't been mentioned yet, note that &lt;u&gt;at the cost of performance&lt;/u&gt;, you can get accurate calculations by adding a [doc://bignum|&lt;c&gt;use bignum;&lt;/c&gt;] to your code. Note that its scope is lexical, so you can limit the performance impact a bit by only applying it where needed in your code.&lt;/p&gt;
